7F3F33D8653E8B88FD91F9232403\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"135\",\"title\":\"FC68Rise of the French monarchy (c.1000-1300) - The Flow of History\",\"description\":\"However, the succession of Louis VI in to the throne in 1108 marked the beginning of over two centuries of expansion for the French monarchy and the Capetian ...\",\"url\":\"http://www.flowofhistory.com/category/export/html/212.html\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"136\",\"title\":\"\",\"description\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://www.degruyterbrill.com/document/doi/10.1515/9780691213057-008/html\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"137\",\"title\":\"British History in depth: Common Law - Henry II and the Birth of a State\",\"description\":\"Feb 17, 2011 · Henry II's reforms regarding land law protected tenants against their lords, by allowing them to look to the lord's superior, the king. It is ...Law and the State · Law before Henry II and the... · The Angevin Legal Reforms\",\"url\":\"https://www.bbc.co.uk/history/british/middle_ages/henryii_law_01.shtml\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"138\",\"title\":\"Henry II and the Creation of the English Common Law\",\"description\":\"Sep 12, 2012 · The reign of Henry II has long been regarded, and rightly, as a period of major importance in the history of English law.\",\"url\":\"https://www.cambridge.org/core/books/henry-ii/henry-ii-and-the-creation-of-the-english-common-law/FADA3B5AD4E01E89B8718119F620B1A2\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"139\",\"title\":\"British History, 2: The Origins of Common Law\",\"description\":\"Henry II's most important innovation may have been the establishment of the Grand Jury, which created a coherent system for prosecuting crime based on the ...\",\"url\":\"https://users.ssc.wisc.edu/~rkeyser/?page_id=625\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"140\",\"title\":\"[PDF] THE COMMON LAW AND CIVIL LAW TRADITIONS - UC Berkeley Law\",\"description\":\"Originally writs were royal orders from the court of the English king. Yearbooks/reports – collections of common law